Report will include:
・Project name, URL, project number, manager, start and completion dates;
・Challenge and project KPIs, outcomes addressed or unmet;
・Achievements (especially around collaboration/engagement), learnings, next-stage plans, final reflections, and links to relevant sources/documents;
・A working, accessible link to the Close‑out Video.

Video will:
・Be public and in 720p or 1080p quality;
・Be 2–5 minutes long;
・Clearly demonstrate outputs—like the API/SDK functionality—or otherwise make the work visible;
